# The reverse direction of "the editor and the runtime load identical
# Worlds" (M11/M13 integration; rampage.plays_an_editor_saved_scene): a
# Stress generator press of enemy-prefab instances, the scene saved with
# prefab references (kPrefabs), then a short Play, whose replay
# (<pref>/sessions/last-play.sereplay) holds the Play-start bytes the test
# replays with se_replay. Runs on a copy of the content.
expect-entities document 17
stress-press 20
wait-frames 1
expect-entities document 37
save
wait-saves
expect-dirty no
play
wait-ticks 5
stop
wait-frames 2
expect-state edit
wait-saves
quit discard
